# AQFM Preprocessing — Walkthrough

## What Was Done

The preprocessing pipeline ([preprocess_aqfm.py](file:///c:/Users/phala/Foundation%20Model/preprocess_aqfm.py)) ran successfully in ~2.5 minutes and produced model-ready arrays from raw CPCB + ERA5 data.

