## Key Results

### ERA5 Gap-Filling (Step 2)

ERA5 weather data filled CPCB meteorological gaps almost perfectly:

| Channel | Gaps Filled | Result |
|---------|------------|--------|
| AT (Temperature) | 4.4M / 4.4M | **100%** filled |
| RH (Humidity) | 3.2M / 3.2M | **100%** filled |
| WS (Wind Speed) | 3.3M / 3.3M | **100%** filled |
| WD (Wind Direction) | 3.3M / 3.3M | **100%** filled |
| SR (Solar Radiation) | 3.4M / 3.4M | **100%** filled |
| BP (Pressure) | 4.4M / 4.4M | **100%** filled |
| TOT_RF (Rainfall) | 1.0M / 1.0M | **100%** filled |

All 7 met channels now have **~100% observation rate** — the model will never see a missing weather value.

